cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its underlying analysis, please cite the associated publication."
title: "PAM-G: Predictive Activity Modelling of Glucose in Type 1 Diabetes"
abstract: "Temporal gradient analysis of blood glucose responses to non-standard physical activity in Type 1 Diabetes under free-living conditions. Uses synchronised Philips Actiwatch activity counts and Dexcom G6 continuous glucose monitoring data to test whether non-standard PA precedes accelerated BG decline across 20-, 40-, and 60-minute windows."
